1
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:43,000
=Ren Yu=
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

2
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,000
=Episode 4=

3
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:52,439
It's been days.

4
00:01:52,959 --> 00:01:54,159
If it were Lin,

5
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:56,280
the police would've found you at once.

6
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,319
Do you think they're that useless?

7
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,280
Honey.

8
00:01:59,280 --> 00:01:59,879
Besides,

9
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:03,959
girls arguing wouldn't kill anyone.

10
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,959
We're scaring ourselves.

11
00:02:06,079 --> 00:02:08,240
My heart won't stop racing. I...

12
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,879
What if Lin...

13
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:13,759
Get Su Zhe enrolled tomorrow.

14
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,759
Honey.

15
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,039
Until Lin comes home,

16
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,960
I can't go on like this.

17
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,560
They're still looking for her.

18
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:22,039
We can handle both.

19
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,039
Stop going on about it.

20
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:25,159
And listen.

21
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:29,120
If anyone asks,

22
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:33,599
say Lin went out of town.

23
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,199
Don't let anything slip.

24
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:37,400
But Lin still isn't back.

25
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,620
Come on.

26
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:42,840
Let Mr. Ma arrange Su Zhe's school.

27
00:02:43,479 --> 00:02:44,960
If he changes his mind,

28
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,759
we can't pay the money back.

29
00:02:56,039 --> 00:02:56,680
Where to?

30
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:57,599
Aren't you eating?

31
00:02:58,639 --> 00:02:59,120
Don't cook.

32
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:01,039
We'll eat out.

33
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,719
Dad, are you ready?

34
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,199
What's the rush? I'm ready.

35
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,240
Once there,

36
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,319
I'll have braised prawns,

37
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:10,599
fish stew, lion's head meatballs,

38
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:11,680
and sweet-and-sour ribs.

39
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:14,039
Where'd you learn all those dishes?

40
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:14,639
On TV.

41
00:03:14,639 --> 00:03:15,240
Eating out?

42
00:03:18,159 --> 00:03:19,240
What's the occasion?

43
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,719
Nothing special.

44
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,360
He kept pestering me.

45
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:24,879
Your sister isn't going?

46
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:26,120
My sister?

47
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,719
She's at the school summer camp.

48
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:29,800
Your mom isn't going as well?

49
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,400
She said she isn't hungry.

50
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,199
We're leaving.

51
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,360
Hurry, Dad.

52
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:40,840
Don't run.

53
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,560
Mrs. Su.

54
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:56,919
It's Gu.

55
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:03,400
Mr. Gu.

56
00:04:04,039 --> 00:04:04,800
Look at me.

57
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:06,520
I live alone,

58
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,680
so I always cook too much.

59
00:04:08,919 --> 00:04:10,520
I made pork and brought you some.

60
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:11,840
That's a lot of meat.

61
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:12,719
Thank you so much.

62
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,599
Sure.

63
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:14,960
Is Lin home?

64
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,600
I need her help.

65
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:22,199
My godson gave me a VCR.

66
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:24,079
The manual's all in English.

67
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:25,199
I can't read any of it.

68
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:27,360
I want Lin to translate it.

69
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,879
Lin isn't home.

70
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,079
Mr. Gu, thanks for the pork.

71
00:04:31,319 --> 00:04:32,079
- Sure.
- Thanks.

72
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,639
She isn't back from school?

73
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,319
Have her call me when she gets back.

74
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:47,879
Mr. Gu.

75
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:50,680
Lin went to visit relatives.

76
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,399
She won't be back for a while.

77
00:04:53,279 --> 00:04:54,399
Visiting relatives?

78
00:04:56,439 --> 00:04:57,399
I'm in no hurry.

79
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:59,000
She'll be back in a few days.

80
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,560
She won't be back that soon.

81
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,759
Well...

82
00:05:04,399 --> 00:05:06,519
After the college entrance exam.

83
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:09,120
She'll return after the exam.

84
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:12,240
She's with relatives for the exam?

85
00:05:13,319 --> 00:05:14,040
So suddenly?

86
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,480
Well,

87
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,480
over there,

88
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:22,240
the admission cutoff is lower.

89
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:24,120
And she's always wanted

90
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:25,319
to go to college.

91
00:05:26,279 --> 00:05:27,120
That's good news.

92
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,000
Yes, it is.

93
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:30,920
Some cities

94
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:32,839
do have lower cutoffs.

95
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,079
Yes, exactly.

96
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,079
A friend's son

97
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,879
is also looking for a place

98
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:39,879
to take the exam.

99
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,680
Which city is it?

100
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,399
Somewhere south. My head...

101
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,120
My head hurts.

102
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,120
Mr. Gu, I...

103
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,680
I need to lie down.

104
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,079
I'm sorry.

105
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:04,959
The south.

106
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:12,800
Here.

107
00:06:13,519 --> 00:06:13,959
Look.

108
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,079
Misandao pastries.

109
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:16,759
Fresh and still warm.

110
00:06:17,519 --> 00:06:19,319
They say this shop makes the best.

111
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:21,480
There was only one box left.

112
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:22,920
I grabbed it for you.

113
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:23,800
Here, Ting.

114
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:26,639
Here.

115
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:29,480
No, thanks. I just brushed my teeth.

116
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,199
That's fine.

117
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,480
You can save them for tomorrow.

118
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:37,519
Listen to Mom.

119
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,480
Would you like some?

120
00:06:50,839 --> 00:06:51,279
Ting.

121
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:53,839
Did you upset your mom again?

122
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:57,199
You know how your mom is.

123
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:58,319
She's impatient,

124
00:06:58,959 --> 00:06:59,560
but deep down,

125
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,399
she has a heart of gold.

126
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:03,079
You're grown now.

127
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:05,439
Try to understand your mother.

128
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,199
Not busy anymore?

129
00:07:09,399 --> 00:07:10,399
You have time

130
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:12,439
to lecture me on parenting?

131
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,360
If you have time,

132
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,360
go lecture your wife.

133
00:07:19,199 --> 00:07:19,720
Yushu.

134
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:20,720
Work

135
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,079
used to keep me busy,

136
00:07:22,839 --> 00:07:24,000
but things are different now.

137
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:25,920
I've been promoted.

138
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:28,199
I'll have plenty of time.

139
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,959
Whatever Ting wants to eat

140
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,879
or use,

141
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:34,160
wherever she wants to attend college,

142
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:36,439
I can make it happen.

143
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,560
Ting.

144
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,439
Don't you have school tomorrow?

145
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:54,879
I'm going to bed.

146
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:57,560
Get some rest.

147
00:08:03,839 --> 00:08:04,360
Sit down.

148
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:06,879
I need to talk.

149
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,120
Look.

150
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,639
On my business trip to Beijing,

151
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,120
I stopped by Wangfujing Department Store

152
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:17,240
and bought you some skincare.

153
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,759
They said this brand is all the rage.

154
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,480
Try it.

155
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:22,879
My skin's not that great.

156
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,639
Other brands give me a rash.

157
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,600
Who says your skin isn't good?

158
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:28,360
It looks great.

159
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:29,160
Take it back.

160
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,320
All these years,

161
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,039
you're still just as stubborn.

162
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:37,440
Well.

163
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:38,600
This.

164
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:39,600
Here.

165
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:40,639
This is

166
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,120
for Ting.

167
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:43,759
She's grown up.

168
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:46,120
I don't know what she likes to eat

169
00:08:46,159 --> 00:08:46,799
or use anymore.

170
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,000
I asked the salesperson.

171
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:51,240
They said kids her age

172
00:08:51,519 --> 00:08:52,720
love this kind of thing.

173
00:08:53,399 --> 00:08:53,960
I hope it's okay.

174
00:08:54,279 --> 00:08:54,600
Here.

175
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,200
We were a family once.

176
00:09:08,799 --> 00:09:10,080
It's from family.

177
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,799
Please don't refuse it.

178
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,399
You said it yourself.

179
00:09:14,759 --> 00:09:15,360
Once.

180
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:18,799
That was then.

181
00:09:19,279 --> 00:09:19,919
Yes.

182
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:21,720
Back then,

183
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:23,799
I always thought work came first.

184
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,360
I failed this family.

185
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:29,840
When you wanted to visit Beijing,

186
00:09:30,639 --> 00:09:31,440
I said no.

187
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:33,240
When your coworkers bought skincare

188
00:09:33,559 --> 00:09:34,240
and you also wanted some,

189
00:09:34,919 --> 00:09:35,919
I said we had to save.

190
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,639
I was wrong.

191
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,159
Looking back now,

192
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:47,120
I didn't care enough about you.

193
00:09:47,799 --> 00:09:48,840
Is that why

194
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,919
we ended?

195
00:09:52,519 --> 00:09:53,720
Whatever the reason,

196
00:09:54,159 --> 00:09:55,200
it was my fault.

197
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,879
Whoever was at fault,

198
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:59,320
yours or hers,

199
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,159
it's over now.

200
00:10:01,919 --> 00:10:02,320
Right.

201
00:10:03,399 --> 00:10:03,799
It's over.

202
00:10:04,159 --> 00:10:04,559
Over.

203
00:10:04,840 --> 00:10:05,519
It's all over.

204
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:07,519
That means we don't bring it up again.

205
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,120
Doing so would only hurt me again.

206
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,000
Take it back.

207
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:15,519
Take it with you.

208
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,600
Keep it. Please.

209
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,279
Your little act is over.

210
00:10:19,559 --> 00:10:20,360
That's enough.

211
00:10:20,679 --> 00:10:21,799
This isn't an act.

212
00:10:21,919 --> 00:10:22,440
I'm sincere.

213
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,440
Stop making a scene.

214
00:10:24,559 --> 00:10:25,039
Fine.

215
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,720
Do I need to spell it out?

216
00:10:29,679 --> 00:10:31,039
Everything you've done lately

217
00:10:31,039 --> 00:10:32,159
is unlike you.

218
00:10:34,519 --> 00:10:36,240
I can't help but notice

219
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,399
something's wrong.

220
00:10:37,879 --> 00:10:38,840
Very wrong.

221
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,960
I'll leave you alone.

222
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,840
You leave me alone.

223
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,200
All right?

224
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:44,960
Take all of this back.

225
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,039
Fine.

226
00:10:48,799 --> 00:10:49,919
Keep Ting's things.

227
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:51,080
Take this with you.

228
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,200
Take it back.

229
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:53,840
I don't want or need it.

230
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:58,000
So much for trying to help.

231
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:22,159
Can you hold up?

232
00:11:24,519 --> 00:11:25,480
I know my limits.

233
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:27,279
This isn't new.

234
00:11:27,519 --> 00:11:28,639
You know your limits?

235
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,919
It looks to me

236
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,919
like we'll need a doctor on the team.

237
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,440
I know you're anxious.

238
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:44,159
I'm even more anxious than you are.

239
00:11:44,879 --> 00:11:46,159
Based on what we know,

240
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,600
this is a particularly vicious

241
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,519
serial murder case.

242
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:51,480
I'll report it immediately

243
00:11:51,759 --> 00:11:52,559
and form a task force.

244
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,480
You'll lead it.

245
00:11:53,799 --> 00:11:55,159
I'll give it everything.

246
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:55,840
Wait.

247
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,360
Is that what I meant?

248
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,559
Don't work yourself ragged.

249
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:01,799
Director Hu.

250
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,480
This case began with nothing.

251
00:12:04,519 --> 00:12:05,639
What else can I do?

252
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,679
What I mean is,

253
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,519
don't wear the entire team out.

254
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:09,840
And you.

255
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,200
Rest before planning your next move.

256
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,399
I know.

257
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:13,840
You...

258
00:12:14,039 --> 00:12:15,080
They're still young.

259
00:12:15,879 --> 00:12:16,879
This transfer to desk duty,

260
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,440
you should take it seriously.

261
00:12:18,799 --> 00:12:20,559
We'll talk after this case is solved.

262
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,360
This is so complicated.

263
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:29,559
It makes no sense.

264
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,279
But it's the best map.

265
00:12:32,399 --> 00:12:35,480
Most cities have one sewer network.

266
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,960
Ours is unusual.

267
00:12:38,039 --> 00:12:40,480
Sewage and stormwater are separate.

268
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,440
The system runs 47 kilometers,

269
00:12:44,039 --> 00:12:45,080
five meters underground.

270
00:12:46,159 --> 00:12:47,000
I suggest

271
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:50,080
we enter through this storm drain.

272
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:52,600
Watch your step.

273
00:12:52,919 --> 00:12:53,720
Stairs here.

274
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,519
The air quality is poor down here.

275
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,559
We'll be fine if we're quick.

276
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:04,600
Stay too long,

277
00:13:04,919 --> 00:13:05,759
then who knows?

278
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,039
He's the expert.

279
00:13:13,759 --> 00:13:15,240
Throughout history,

280
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:17,440
whether it was the Roman-built sewers

281
00:13:17,519 --> 00:13:19,320
in Paris,

282
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:23,120
or the Fushou Canal in Ganzhou, Jiangxi,

283
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:25,840
built during the Northern Song Dynasty,

284
00:13:26,559 --> 00:13:28,480
they were all masterpieces.

285
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:29,879
The very best.

286
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:31,000
Did you know that?

287
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:32,080
You're the scholar.

288
00:13:32,159 --> 00:13:32,960
Never heard of it.

289
00:13:33,039 --> 00:13:33,879
You haven't?

290
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:34,879
I'll teach you.

291
00:13:43,519 --> 00:13:44,240
Where's Tai Wei?

292
00:13:44,559 --> 00:13:45,919
Why hasn't that kid caught up?

293
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:49,399
Tai Wei!

294
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:54,600
Tai Wei!

295
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,000
Can you hear me?

296
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:56,960
Answer if you can.

297
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,200
No signal here.

298
00:14:00,039 --> 00:14:00,759
Further inside.

299
00:14:01,759 --> 00:14:03,399
Captain! Can you hear me?

300
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,120
Captain, where are you?

301
00:14:09,159 --> 00:14:10,080
Which way should I go?

302
00:14:18,759 --> 00:14:19,679
No, this is wrong.

303
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,360
The entrance is there.

304
00:14:22,559 --> 00:14:25,200
Walk 15 meters, then turn right.

305
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,120
Why is there an extra junction?

306
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,480
You mean

307
00:14:29,559 --> 00:14:30,279
this area

308
00:14:30,279 --> 00:14:31,840
doesn't match the map?

309
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:32,919
It doesn't.

310
00:14:33,759 --> 00:14:35,799
It must've been expanded later.

311
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:38,759
It's more complex than I expected.

312
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:41,240
There may be countless junctions.

313
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,360
Tai Wei!

314
00:14:43,679 --> 00:14:44,480
Answer me!

315
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:56,300
(Chaobei Vocational High School
Training Department)

316
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,240
What exactly are you looking for?

317
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,000
A woman's body washed out
of Weihong Canal.

318
00:15:02,519 --> 00:15:03,240
We want to know

319
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,240
if these tunnels

320
00:15:04,799 --> 00:15:06,440
hold any more bodies.

321
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:09,480
What's wrong?

322
00:15:09,679 --> 00:15:11,159
You're looking for bodies?

323
00:15:12,399 --> 00:15:13,120
Scared?

324
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,159
Who wouldn't be?

325
00:15:14,519 --> 00:15:16,000
Finding a body down here

326
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,519
is a needle in a haystack.

327
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,000
And you had to drag me along.

328
00:15:19,879 --> 00:15:21,440
You are coming back, right?

329
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:22,600
We have to.

330
00:15:23,039 --> 00:15:24,639
This could be the first dump site.

331
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:25,320
Dump...

332
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,039
Dump site?

333
00:15:28,799 --> 00:15:29,799
You mean

334
00:15:30,039 --> 00:15:31,440
the killer could be down here?

335
00:15:34,679 --> 00:15:36,279
Engineer Chen, relax.

336
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:37,360
I have my service pistol.

337
00:15:45,639 --> 00:15:46,320
I'm not going.

338
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:47,840
I'm not going.

339
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:48,799
I'm not going!

340
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,519
Why the tantrum?

341
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:02,919
Where did you come from?

342
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:03,919
You scared me!

343
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,679
I've looked everywhere for you.

344
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:10,600
You nearly scared me to death!

345
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,120
Where are we?

346
00:16:18,279 --> 00:16:19,919
Another tunnel junction.

347
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,399
Chen,

348
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,519
how many junctions like this

349
00:16:25,279 --> 00:16:26,240
are there in total?

350
00:16:26,559 --> 00:16:27,279
How many?

351
00:16:28,519 --> 00:16:29,440
Several hundred.

352
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,039
Chen.

353
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:35,720
With so many routes branching off,

354
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:39,279
where do they all lead?

355
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:43,200
All across the city.

356
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:45,600
Everywhere.

357
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,799
Twenty-second.

358
00:17:43,079 --> 00:17:44,440
(She isn't back from school?)

359
00:17:44,839 --> 00:17:46,799
(Have her call me when she gets back.)

360
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,559
(She won't be back that soon.)

361
00:17:49,119 --> 00:17:51,160
(She'll return after the exam.)

362
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,720
(Your sister isn't going?)

363
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,440
(She's at the school summer camp.)

364
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:56,960
(I'm entering)

365
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:58,519
(provincial English recitation contest.)

366
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:22,759
- Come on.
- Easy.

367
00:18:26,119 --> 00:18:26,880
- Careful.
- Captain.

368
00:18:27,359 --> 00:18:27,839
Careful.

369
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,400
Watch out.

370
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:30,920
Careful.

371
00:18:33,079 --> 00:18:34,759
Let go.

372
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:39,200
Your hand?

373
00:18:39,839 --> 00:18:41,200
Nothing. A rat bit me.

374
00:18:41,599 --> 00:18:42,240
What?

375
00:18:42,759 --> 00:18:43,759
A rat bit me.

376
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:44,480
Let me see.

377
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,079
That's serious.

378
00:18:47,119 --> 00:18:48,119
I'm fine.

379
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:51,519
What?

380
00:18:52,799 --> 00:18:53,480
Your eyes.

381
00:18:54,839 --> 00:18:55,400
They're red.

382
00:18:58,119 --> 00:18:58,799
All of these

383
00:18:59,039 --> 00:19:00,559
came from the sewer.

384
00:19:00,559 --> 00:19:02,200
I searched it thoroughly

385
00:19:02,359 --> 00:19:04,440
and found these suspicious items.

386
00:19:05,759 --> 00:19:08,759
This handmade leather bag is intact.

387
00:19:09,119 --> 00:19:10,359
So why throw it away?

388
00:19:11,079 --> 00:19:12,160
And the pager.

389
00:19:12,559 --> 00:19:13,720
Have it repaired

390
00:19:13,799 --> 00:19:15,640
and check the messages inside.

391
00:19:16,079 --> 00:19:17,000
The high heel, too.

392
00:19:17,559 --> 00:19:19,799
Could it relate to the killer's fetish?

393
00:19:20,079 --> 00:19:21,759
We can't rule it out.

394
00:19:22,039 --> 00:19:22,960
That's imagination,

395
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:24,119
not logic.

396
00:19:24,519 --> 00:19:25,319
The badge?

397
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:28,279
No one would just throw it away.

398
00:19:29,799 --> 00:19:31,200
We need evidence to infer

399
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,519
motive and circumstances.

400
00:19:32,839 --> 00:19:34,319
Even trash can become a clue.

401
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:35,880
We're seeking evidence.

402
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:37,359
Look at you.

403
00:19:37,799 --> 00:19:39,119
You two are a mess.

404
00:19:39,599 --> 00:19:40,720
I told you to rest early,

405
00:19:40,839 --> 00:19:41,880
yet you made a huge mess.

406
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:42,880
That's enough.

407
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:44,720
Drop your work and go rest.

408
00:19:56,519 --> 00:19:57,759
There's a lot of pressure from above.

409
00:19:58,880 --> 00:19:59,599
Lay low for two days.

410
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,160
Sort through the leads.

411
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:03,359
Don't cause trouble.

412
00:20:05,119 --> 00:20:06,000
Don't worry.

413
00:20:17,580 --> 00:20:20,840
(Chaobei Vocational High School)

414
00:20:26,519 --> 00:20:27,200
Flying Dragon!

415
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:31,079
Hey you.

416
00:20:31,119 --> 00:20:32,480
Your arm gets stronger every day.

417
00:20:32,559 --> 00:20:33,200
Why here?

418
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:33,680
Gu.

419
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,279
Why are you here?

420
00:20:35,559 --> 00:20:36,359
I'm working a case.

421
00:20:36,519 --> 00:20:37,480
My team's inside.

422
00:20:41,279 --> 00:20:42,400
You have a case here?

423
00:20:44,079 --> 00:20:44,680
Perfect.

424
00:20:45,799 --> 00:20:47,519
I came to ask about a student.

425
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,039
When you're done,

426
00:20:49,559 --> 00:20:50,839
I need to tell you something.

427
00:20:51,279 --> 00:20:52,039
Which student?

428
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:54,640
My neighbor, Su Lin.

429
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:57,319
The school has

430
00:20:57,359 --> 00:20:59,160
1,214 students in total.

431
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,359
All listed here.

432
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:03,240
No one has skipped without cause.

433
00:21:04,279 --> 00:21:05,160
The school

434
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,240
has been on alert lately.

435
00:21:07,160 --> 00:21:08,839
If a student is absent without leave,

436
00:21:09,079 --> 00:21:11,319
their teacher calls home immediately.

437
00:21:11,559 --> 00:21:12,000
All right.

438
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:14,559
I'm Officer Tai's colleague.

439
00:21:15,039 --> 00:21:15,599
May I ask,

440
00:21:15,599 --> 00:21:16,480
would a transfer

441
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,680
be missing from the register?

442
00:21:19,039 --> 00:21:19,880
Of course not.

443
00:21:20,519 --> 00:21:22,119
Our records are meticulous.

444
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:24,480
If they attended for even one day,

445
00:21:24,799 --> 00:21:25,799
they'd be in this file.

446
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:26,480
All right.

447
00:21:26,799 --> 00:21:27,240
Relax.

448
00:21:29,200 --> 00:21:29,799
Thank you.

449
00:21:30,119 --> 00:21:31,599
We only needed some information.

450
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:32,799
Sorry you had to join us.

451
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:33,480
We apologize.

452
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:35,039
Not at all.

453
00:21:35,119 --> 00:21:36,559
It's our duty to help.

454
00:21:37,079 --> 00:21:37,759
Thanks.

455
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,519
No one's missing from here.

456
00:21:43,039 --> 00:21:44,640
I really was being paranoid.

457
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,559
Do you suspect

458
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:52,039
the body from Weihong Canal

459
00:21:52,839 --> 00:21:54,839
is linked to a student here?

460
00:21:55,839 --> 00:21:56,359
I...

461
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:57,720
Fine.

462
00:21:58,119 --> 00:22:00,079
Rules say you can't tell me.

463
00:22:00,119 --> 00:22:00,960
I shouldn't ask.

464
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:04,359
But

465
00:22:04,839 --> 00:22:06,680
this child I'm looking for

466
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:07,640
is a strange case.

467
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:09,160
I saw her every day.

468
00:22:09,599 --> 00:22:12,559
Her uniform and badge were from here.

469
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:14,400
How could her name

470
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,319
not be registered?

471
00:22:16,039 --> 00:22:17,759
The registrar lied?

472
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:19,079
I don't know.

473
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:21,519
But she suddenly vanished.

474
00:22:22,079 --> 00:22:22,720
Isn't it odd?

475
00:22:24,680 --> 00:22:25,720
Maybe we're overthinking.

476
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:28,640
If you're free, come to my place.

477
00:22:29,079 --> 00:22:29,519
Come on.

478
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:32,880
Since you're here,

479
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:39,839
take Principal Dong home safely.

480
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:40,880
You can count on me.

481
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:41,799
The trunk.

482
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:43,200
Understood, Mr. Ma.

483
00:22:43,319 --> 00:22:45,160
You really shouldn't have.

484
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:46,839
My daughter's counting on you.

485
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:51,160
All right. That's enough.

486
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,079
- Bye.
- Take care.

487
00:23:11,079 --> 00:23:11,640
Go home.

488
00:23:14,480 --> 00:23:16,720
That girl is my English teacher.

489
00:23:17,079 --> 00:23:17,920
She teaches me.

490
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:19,839
I fry her two eggs every night

491
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:20,559
as tuition.

492
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:21,759
But

493
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:23,079
five days now.

494
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:25,039
I haven't seen her since.

495
00:23:25,799 --> 00:23:27,440
When did you last see her?

496
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:28,680
The stormy day.

497
00:23:31,839 --> 00:23:32,519
Off to school?

498
00:23:34,319 --> 00:23:34,880
Mr. Gu.

499
00:23:40,839 --> 00:23:41,519
What is it now?

500
00:23:43,799 --> 00:23:45,119
They're forecasting heavy rain today.

501
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:46,200
Got an umbrella?

502
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:47,400
That was

503
00:23:47,559 --> 00:23:48,559
May 23rd.

504
00:23:53,519 --> 00:23:54,640
On May 24th,

505
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,400
a body was found in Weihong Canal.

506
00:24:12,680 --> 00:24:14,200
That timeline overlaps

507
00:24:15,359 --> 00:24:16,160
with your case.

508
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:18,200
Let's lay it all out.

509
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:19,680
You said earlier

510
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:21,480
this family

511
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:23,559
lied about

512
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:24,720
where she was.

513
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:25,640
Yes.

514
00:24:26,359 --> 00:24:27,119
I tested them.

515
00:24:27,799 --> 00:24:28,799
Their stories clashed.

516
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:31,319
Her brother said she was at camp.

517
00:24:31,559 --> 00:24:33,400
Her mother said she was with relatives.

518
00:24:33,799 --> 00:24:34,960
What relative matters enough

519
00:24:35,279 --> 00:24:36,480
to miss school for a visit?

520
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:37,880
I asked again.

521
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:40,720
Then she said she went south for exams.

522
00:24:41,359 --> 00:24:42,119
It sounded

523
00:24:42,519 --> 00:24:43,279
like she was stuck

524
00:24:43,279 --> 00:24:44,400
and made up an excuse.

525
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:46,599
I believe you.

526
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:47,720
You're a former cop.

527
00:24:48,440 --> 00:24:49,400
Your judgment is sound.

528
00:24:50,039 --> 00:24:51,559
Did you notice anything else?

529
00:24:54,759 --> 00:24:55,440
Two days ago,

530
00:24:55,599 --> 00:24:56,759
I heard crying in their home.

531
00:24:56,880 --> 00:24:59,039
(Why would you do this?)

532
00:25:00,039 --> 00:25:02,160
(Why?)

533
00:25:02,799 --> 00:25:03,680
But yesterday,

534
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:06,839
they seemed to be celebrating.

535
00:25:07,440 --> 00:25:08,480
Especially her brother.

536
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:09,359
(Once there,)

537
00:25:09,359 --> 00:25:10,400
(I want braised prawns,)

538
00:25:10,599 --> 00:25:11,640
(fish stew, lion's head meatballs,)

539
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:12,799
(and sweet-sour ribs.)

540
00:25:12,880 --> 00:25:13,839
He seemed thrilled.

541
00:25:14,119 --> 00:25:14,559
But

542
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:16,279
the girl's mother

543
00:25:17,079 --> 00:25:17,799
seemed dazed.

544
00:25:18,200 --> 00:25:20,640
You think all this is connected

545
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:21,799
to her case?

546
00:25:22,359 --> 00:25:23,599
I don't know if it is.

547
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:25,680
It's a hunch.

548
00:25:28,319 --> 00:25:29,519
But her name being absent

549
00:25:29,599 --> 00:25:31,680
from the register makes no sense.

550
00:25:34,680 --> 00:25:35,880
Crying in the house

551
00:25:37,119 --> 00:25:38,559
means something bad happened.

552
00:25:40,599 --> 00:25:42,960
From bad news to good,

553
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:44,440
what happened in between?

554
00:25:46,759 --> 00:25:47,200
(Okay.)

555
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,480
(That's settled, Su.)

556
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:51,359
(I'll tell you when it's done.)

557
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:52,799
Someone visited in between.

558
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:53,880
Who?

559
00:25:55,319 --> 00:25:55,920
Mr. Ma.

560
00:25:56,559 --> 00:25:57,039
Gu.

561
00:25:57,359 --> 00:25:58,480
You don't know what he does?

562
00:25:58,920 --> 00:25:59,640
No.

563
00:26:00,599 --> 00:26:02,759
But he was clearly a businessman.

564
00:26:03,559 --> 00:26:05,839
He and the Su family aren't friends?

565
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,240
One's a businessman,

566
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:09,319
the other a laborer.

567
00:26:10,079 --> 00:26:11,359
I could tell they weren't close.

568
00:26:12,039 --> 00:26:12,559
But

569
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:14,519
Mr. Ma

570
00:26:15,200 --> 00:26:16,640
was very polite to the Su family.

571
00:26:17,400 --> 00:26:18,240
What would a boss

572
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:22,119
possibly need from a laborer?

573
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:24,000
A rich man asked them for a favor.

574
00:26:24,640 --> 00:26:26,240
So that was the good news.

575
00:26:28,359 --> 00:26:29,559
Then why was she crying?

576
00:26:32,839 --> 00:26:33,440
She was crying

577
00:26:36,839 --> 00:26:37,799
because of the bad news.

578
00:26:39,960 --> 00:26:40,480
Gu.

579
00:26:40,559 --> 00:26:42,200
Do you think Mr. Ma

580
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:43,839
might have some direct

581
00:26:43,839 --> 00:26:44,960
connection to the girl?

582
00:26:45,440 --> 00:26:46,640
What could link them?

583
00:26:48,319 --> 00:26:49,680
Su Lin is a good kid.

584
00:26:50,519 --> 00:26:51,759
She goes straight home

585
00:26:52,440 --> 00:26:53,680
and helps with the housework.

586
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:56,960
What if

587
00:26:59,359 --> 00:27:01,039
an accident involving Mr. Ma

588
00:27:01,359 --> 00:27:03,000
caused the girl to disappear?

589
00:27:04,279 --> 00:27:04,920
An accident?

590
00:27:10,079 --> 00:27:11,160
That's why he visited them.

591
00:27:12,519 --> 00:27:13,319
He offered money

592
00:27:14,039 --> 00:27:15,200
or other terms

593
00:27:15,960 --> 00:27:16,759
to appease the family.

594
00:27:17,279 --> 00:27:18,680
So even if they knew

595
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:20,079
their daughter was missing,

596
00:27:20,799 --> 00:27:21,640
they never called the police.

597
00:27:31,319 --> 00:27:33,000
Su Zhe asked about Lin again.

598
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:36,079
How long can we hide this from him?

599
00:27:36,920 --> 00:27:38,519
What if something happened to Lin?

600
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:40,359
What would we do?

601
00:28:25,340 --> 00:28:27,880
(Police Station)

602
00:28:42,340 --> 00:28:48,680
(Body Identification Notice)

603
00:28:57,519 --> 00:28:58,079
Excuse me,

604
00:29:00,359 --> 00:29:01,240
do you need help?

605
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:06,440
(I'll keep my end of the deal.)

606
00:29:07,119 --> 00:29:08,839
(You'd better keep yours.)

607
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:13,480
(You know how his registration)

608
00:29:13,559 --> 00:29:14,359
(got approved.)

609
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:17,640
(So tell no one about Su Lin.)

610
00:29:19,079 --> 00:29:21,160
(Dad had no other choice.)

611
00:29:27,119 --> 00:29:27,559
It's fine.

612
00:29:29,079 --> 00:29:29,640
It's fine.

613
00:29:51,559 --> 00:29:52,240
Liang.

614
00:29:53,799 --> 00:29:56,720
Your daughter's in grade school now?

615
00:29:57,039 --> 00:29:58,119
Already in second grade.

616
00:29:59,640 --> 00:30:00,319
Time flies.

617
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:01,839
How is she?

618
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:03,160
She's doing well.

619
00:30:03,519 --> 00:30:04,720
Her teacher often praises her.

620
00:30:08,759 --> 00:30:11,039
Raising a daughter takes it out of you.

621
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,640
She'll give you trouble someday.

622
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:17,519
All kids do.

623
00:30:19,079 --> 00:30:19,920
A bridge is ahead.

624
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:21,279
Pull over there.

625
00:30:21,799 --> 00:30:22,359
Sure.

626
00:30:48,359 --> 00:30:48,839
Dongchen.

627
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:36,640
Gu.

628
00:31:37,119 --> 00:31:38,039
I need to head back.

629
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:39,880
I'm coming with you.

630
00:31:40,559 --> 00:31:41,599
I think what we said

631
00:31:44,279 --> 00:31:44,839
matches up.

632
00:31:51,680 --> 00:31:52,759
The bureau's calling.

633
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:01,799
Tai Wei here.

634
00:32:02,440 --> 00:32:03,000
Tai Wei.

635
00:32:03,559 --> 00:32:04,519
Victim identified.

636
00:32:05,720 --> 00:32:07,279
Her name is...

637
00:32:13,200 --> 00:32:14,759
The victim has been identified.

638
00:32:14,799 --> 00:32:15,839
Not the girl you meant.

639
00:32:16,240 --> 00:32:16,759
Gu.

640
00:32:17,640 --> 00:32:19,400
You really overthought this one.

641
00:32:20,240 --> 00:32:21,839
Then what about Mr. Ma?

642
00:32:22,200 --> 00:32:23,039
Maybe

643
00:32:23,079 --> 00:32:24,920
he's simply a boss

644
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:26,200
who cares about an employee.

645
00:32:26,759 --> 00:32:28,279
Then why isn't Su Lin's name

646
00:32:29,440 --> 00:32:31,319
on the school register?

647
00:32:31,559 --> 00:32:33,039
Why are you so sure

648
00:32:33,039 --> 00:32:34,319
she attends that school?

649
00:32:34,559 --> 00:32:35,839
I saw her leave for school every day.

650
00:32:36,519 --> 00:32:37,920
Did you personally see her

651
00:32:38,079 --> 00:32:39,039
walk into that school?

652
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:43,039
There may be another explanation.

653
00:32:43,279 --> 00:32:44,559
Look into it further.

654
00:32:44,799 --> 00:32:46,559
Besides, the bureau confirmed

655
00:32:46,559 --> 00:32:48,720
the victim was Yang Xinqian.

656
00:32:49,400 --> 00:32:52,079
Why keep analyzing it here?

657
00:32:57,319 --> 00:32:58,799
I'm not crazy, at least.

658
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:01,960
So you're saying I'm crazy?

659
00:33:03,359 --> 00:33:05,119
After you retire,

660
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:06,440
you should write novels.

661
00:33:06,440 --> 00:33:07,960
That story had every detail.

662
00:33:08,319 --> 00:33:09,240
That's your fault.

663
00:33:09,759 --> 00:33:11,519
I spent all that time helping you.

664
00:33:11,519 --> 00:33:12,200
Now you blame me?

665
00:33:12,200 --> 00:33:13,200
You used to be a cop.

666
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:14,119
Gu's pressure strike!

667
00:33:15,160 --> 00:33:17,680
Can we retire that trick already?

668
00:33:19,720 --> 00:33:20,200
I'm done.

669
00:33:20,599 --> 00:33:21,839
Then release me!

670
00:33:25,880 --> 00:33:26,599
Gu.

671
00:33:26,599 --> 00:33:29,359
You haven't lost your touch.

672
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:31,720
What are you doing now?

673
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,559
Spending all afternoon with an old man?

674
00:33:35,519 --> 00:33:36,119
Exactly.

675
00:33:38,319 --> 00:33:38,839
Gu.

676
00:33:45,359 --> 00:33:46,720
I can leave Mom with you

677
00:33:47,039 --> 00:33:48,119
and never worry.

678
00:33:49,519 --> 00:33:50,279
Watch yourself.

679
00:33:51,039 --> 00:33:51,759
I'm serious.

680
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:53,599
If you took her traveling,

681
00:33:53,839 --> 00:33:55,119
I'd have complete peace of mind.

682
00:33:55,559 --> 00:33:56,279
What traveling?

683
00:33:58,079 --> 00:33:59,640
Look at the words you're studying.

684
00:33:59,799 --> 00:34:01,319
They're all about travel.

685
00:34:01,880 --> 00:34:03,319
And who's always talking

686
00:34:03,319 --> 00:34:04,200
of trips? My mom.

687
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:04,920
It all fits.

688
00:34:05,920 --> 00:34:07,960
Use those skills on your cases.

689
00:34:08,440 --> 00:34:09,360
I was right.

690
00:34:09,559 --> 00:34:10,239
About what?

691
00:34:10,360 --> 00:34:11,639
You know I was right.

692
00:34:12,559 --> 00:34:15,519
You've cared for Mom and me for years.

693
00:34:15,800 --> 00:34:18,039
Sixteen years, by my count.

694
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:20,239
I think you and my mom should...

695
00:34:21,639 --> 00:34:22,719
You're going too far.

696
00:34:23,119 --> 00:34:24,079
I'm an adult now.

697
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:25,239
There are things

698
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:26,320
I'm not afraid to say.

699
00:34:26,440 --> 00:34:27,159
Like what?

700
00:34:27,239 --> 00:34:28,960
I think you never married

701
00:34:28,960 --> 00:34:30,239
because of my mom.

702
00:34:32,079 --> 00:34:33,360
Just you wait, you brat.

703
00:34:35,519 --> 00:34:37,079
You've always been good to our family,

704
00:34:37,079 --> 00:34:39,000
especially respectful to my mom.

705
00:34:39,440 --> 00:34:40,960
I hope that later in life,

706
00:34:40,960 --> 00:34:43,079
someone can take good care of her.

707
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:44,440
Why are you so stubborn?

708
00:34:44,639 --> 00:34:46,400
You lose because you never make a move.

709
00:34:46,400 --> 00:34:47,840
Wait any longer and you'll be old.

710
00:34:48,039 --> 00:34:48,639
Bye, Gu.

711
00:34:51,280 --> 00:34:52,719
It's raining, you brat!

712
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:54,119
Take an umbrella.

713
00:34:54,599 --> 00:34:55,199
No need.

714
00:35:01,199 --> 00:35:02,519
This is the third victim.

715
00:35:03,639 --> 00:35:04,719
She just turned 18.

716
00:35:05,239 --> 00:35:06,039
She's Yang Xinqian.

717
00:35:06,679 --> 00:35:07,840
She had a hard life.

718
00:35:08,119 --> 00:35:08,840
She was an orphan,

719
00:35:10,719 --> 00:35:12,440
raised at Chunfeng Orphanage.

720
00:35:14,079 --> 00:35:14,840
The orphanage?

721
00:35:15,519 --> 00:35:16,400
Then why did no one

722
00:35:16,400 --> 00:35:17,280
report her missing?

723
00:35:17,760 --> 00:35:18,639
Over the years,

724
00:35:18,639 --> 00:35:20,239
she made friends outside.

725
00:35:20,440 --> 00:35:21,559
She often skipped school

726
00:35:21,960 --> 00:35:22,599
and stayed out.

727
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:24,400
The orphanage kept searching,

728
00:35:24,719 --> 00:35:25,599
but eventually,

729
00:35:25,920 --> 00:35:27,039
she never came back.

730
00:35:27,679 --> 00:35:29,000
If that's the case,

731
00:35:29,559 --> 00:35:31,079
we can't tell when she disappeared.

732
00:35:31,639 --> 00:35:33,039
But she had complex social ties.

733
00:35:33,119 --> 00:35:34,320
They may give us new leads.

734
00:35:35,159 --> 00:35:37,000
Another massive canvassing operation.

735
00:35:38,159 --> 00:35:39,199
But that's all right.

736
00:35:39,639 --> 00:35:41,599
I brought your all-nighter kit.

737
00:35:43,280 --> 00:35:44,840
Give Su more work.

738
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:46,320
He's still too idle.

739
00:35:46,679 --> 00:35:48,320
He had odd jobs a few days ago.

740
00:35:48,639 --> 00:35:50,280
Now his whole crew is idle.

741
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:51,800
All right. Got it.

742
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:53,599
The development zone mall.

743
00:35:53,760 --> 00:35:54,920
Come to my office tomorrow.

744
00:35:55,719 --> 00:35:56,440
Of course.

745
00:35:57,239 --> 00:35:59,320
I'll keep Su working dawn to dusk.

746
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:02,360
Mr. Ma.

747
00:36:02,840 --> 00:36:03,719
If that's all,

748
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:04,679
I'll be going.

749
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:05,239
Go ahead.

750
00:36:05,800 --> 00:36:06,519
Okay. Goodbye.

751
00:36:07,760 --> 00:36:08,320
Leaving already?

752
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:10,280
Have some water first.

753
00:36:10,360 --> 00:36:11,400
No, thanks. Goodbye.

754
00:36:14,840 --> 00:36:15,400
Honey.

755
00:36:17,039 --> 00:36:17,800
Stop fretting.

756
00:36:18,719 --> 00:36:19,480
Have some tea.

757
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:20,519
Calm yourself.

758
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:22,280
My chest feels tight.

759
00:36:26,000 --> 00:36:27,079
Thanks, honey.

760
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:35,320
Pass it here.

761
00:36:41,559 --> 00:36:42,079
Hello?

762
00:36:42,400 --> 00:36:43,119
(Is this Mr. Ma?)

763
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:44,679
Yes. Go ahead.

764
00:36:45,280 --> 00:36:46,320
(That Weihong Canal case)

765
00:36:46,320 --> 00:36:47,440
(you asked me to watch.)

766
00:36:47,599 --> 00:36:48,599
(Victim identified.)

767
00:36:48,960 --> 00:36:50,079
Who was she?

768
00:36:50,159 --> 00:36:51,239
(An orphanage girl.)

769
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:52,199
(Poor kid.)

770
00:36:52,199 --> 00:36:52,639
I see.

771
00:36:52,639 --> 00:36:53,400
(So I called.)

772
00:36:53,400 --> 00:36:54,239
Thank you.

773
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:54,960
(Gotta go.)

774
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:55,480
All right.

775
00:36:55,599 --> 00:36:56,199
Go ahead.

776
00:36:56,679 --> 00:36:57,280
See you soon.

777
00:36:57,280 --> 00:36:57,719
(Sure.)

778
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:01,440
What is it?

779
00:37:02,440 --> 00:37:04,559
They identified the canal victim.

780
00:37:04,639 --> 00:37:05,920
No connection to Su Lin.

781
00:37:08,440 --> 00:37:09,159
Thank goodness.

782
00:37:09,880 --> 00:37:11,480
I knew we couldn't be that unlucky.

783
00:37:11,920 --> 00:37:13,119
Na only shoved her once.

784
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,199
She couldn't just die from that.

785
00:37:15,719 --> 00:37:16,480
Not that unlucky.

786
00:37:17,119 --> 00:37:19,119
But it's been so many days,

787
00:37:19,679 --> 00:37:21,079
and Su Lin is still missing.

788
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:24,400
That's not good, either.

789
00:37:25,199 --> 00:37:26,559
Honestly.

790
00:37:27,119 --> 00:37:28,639
Stop overthinking it.

791
00:37:29,119 --> 00:37:29,679
No.

792
00:37:30,880 --> 00:37:32,400
I need to visit Su tomorrow.

793
00:37:33,079 --> 00:37:33,719
You know,

794
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:35,119
a few days ago,

795
00:37:35,119 --> 00:37:36,440
Su reached the bureau door.

796
00:37:38,360 --> 00:37:39,239
He went to report it.

797
00:37:39,639 --> 00:37:41,039
We cannot let him do that.

798
00:37:41,679 --> 00:37:42,840
We must stall all we can.

799
00:37:43,599 --> 00:37:45,039
Once his son starts school

800
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:46,519
and they uses the money,

801
00:37:46,559 --> 00:37:47,679
the deal will be done.

802
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:49,679
He won't make trouble for Na.

803
00:37:50,159 --> 00:37:52,119
No. I'll call Yang again.

804
00:37:59,320 --> 00:37:59,800
Hello?

805
00:38:00,119 --> 00:38:00,760
Publisher Yang.

806
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:02,639
I know what tomorrow's

807
00:38:02,639 --> 00:38:04,519
front-page headline should be.

808
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:08,400
Why haven't you written a single word
all this time?

809
00:38:08,719 --> 00:38:09,400
I don't know how.

810
00:38:10,159 --> 00:38:12,000
Then write it a few more times.

811
00:38:12,960 --> 00:38:13,960
Why are you looking at me?

812
00:38:14,159 --> 00:38:15,360
Is the answer on my face?

813
00:38:16,559 --> 00:38:18,480
When is my sister coming back?

814
00:38:18,679 --> 00:38:20,599
Enough. Go do your homework.

815
00:38:23,119 --> 00:38:24,599
All you do is drink.

816
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:26,639
You don't care if Lin lives,

817
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:28,559
or how our son's study.

818
00:38:29,639 --> 00:38:30,599
This bottle's empty.

819
00:38:32,079 --> 00:38:33,320
And this one, too.

820
00:38:33,480 --> 00:38:34,519
Two fine bottles,

821
00:38:34,519 --> 00:38:36,039
gone in a single night.

822
00:38:36,199 --> 00:38:37,719
Do you want to ruin this family?

823
00:38:38,679 --> 00:38:40,000
I've got money.

824
00:38:40,280 --> 00:38:41,079
Keep it down.

825
00:38:43,800 --> 00:38:44,920
Is this really your money?

826
00:38:45,119 --> 00:38:46,440
You can't spend it freely.

827
00:38:46,480 --> 00:38:47,639
What happens when it's gone?

828
00:38:47,880 --> 00:38:48,719
What if you...

829
00:38:48,760 --> 00:38:49,880
Enough.

830
00:38:50,239 --> 00:38:52,119
Stop nagging me all day long.

831
00:38:55,559 --> 00:38:56,159
Listen.

832
00:38:57,440 --> 00:38:59,679
Try this liquor.

833
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:02,800
Expensive liquor tastes better.

834
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:03,360
That's enough.

835
00:39:03,480 --> 00:39:04,280
Try it.

836
00:39:04,320 --> 00:39:05,039
- Listen.
- Move.

837
00:39:05,039 --> 00:39:05,559
Take a sip.

838
00:39:05,559 --> 00:39:06,480
You're a pest drunk.

839
00:39:06,480 --> 00:39:07,679
- You're impossible!
- Try it.

840
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:08,599
I don't want any.

841
00:39:11,320 --> 00:39:11,760
You...

842
00:39:14,320 --> 00:39:15,119
Let go.

843
00:39:19,039 --> 00:39:21,880
Let go of me!

844
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:23,639
What are you doing?

845
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:26,760
What are you doing?

846
00:39:27,719 --> 00:39:28,519
Let go!

847
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:30,679
Mom! Dad!

848
00:39:32,480 --> 00:39:33,760
What are you doing?

849
00:39:34,039 --> 00:39:35,239
Get back inside!

850
00:39:37,320 --> 00:39:38,719
I'll whip your ass, you little brat!

851
00:39:39,480 --> 00:39:40,079
You brat!

852
00:39:40,079 --> 00:39:41,320
Why are you hitting him?

853
00:39:41,960 --> 00:39:43,679
- You brat!
- Stop hitting him!

854
00:39:43,760 --> 00:39:44,760
Don't stop me!

855
00:39:46,679 --> 00:39:47,599
Stay away!

856
00:39:48,639 --> 00:39:49,239
I'll hit you!

857
00:39:49,360 --> 00:39:51,360
A little liquor makes you crazy.

858
00:39:56,740 --> 00:39:59,100
(Maze Game)

859
00:39:59,559 --> 00:40:01,119
(At the bottom left of City Daily,)

860
00:40:01,679 --> 00:40:02,960
(there was a maze game.)

861
00:40:04,000 --> 00:40:05,719
(The answer came the next day.)

862
00:40:07,159 --> 00:40:08,760
(It gave me the illusion)

863
00:40:10,159 --> 00:40:11,960
(that every maze had a way out.)

864
00:40:13,199 --> 00:40:13,960
(In truth,)

865
00:40:14,639 --> 00:40:15,719
(that wasn't so.)

866
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:21,440
Stay back!

867
00:41:21,719 --> 00:41:22,280
What is this?

868
00:41:22,599 --> 00:41:23,280
What is this?

869
00:41:24,639 --> 00:41:25,159
Let go of me!

870
00:41:25,400 --> 00:41:25,880
Let go!

871
00:41:25,960 --> 00:41:26,679
Let me go!

872
00:41:27,199 --> 00:41:27,679
Let go!

873
00:41:28,840 --> 00:41:29,800
What do you want?

874
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:30,800
Let go!

875
00:41:31,239 --> 00:41:31,920
Let go!

876
00:41:35,960 --> 00:41:38,840
Don't touch me!

877
00:41:43,800 --> 00:41:44,920
No!

878
00:41:47,104 --> 00:41:49,580
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

879
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:54,800
(Su Lin)

880
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:01,599
Ma'am.

881
00:42:02,639 --> 00:42:04,360
Do you know why Su Lin dropped out?

882
00:42:05,400 --> 00:42:06,440
Some of her things

883
00:42:06,440 --> 00:42:07,480
(Su Lin)
are in my locker.

884
00:42:09,519 --> 00:42:10,000
Mom.

885
00:42:10,159 --> 00:42:11,119
Where's this pencil case from?

886
00:42:12,039 --> 00:42:12,639
What's wrong?

